pe.card V`. The agent is unsure if any real challenges would have this condition.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"search_web","args":{"query":"\"\\\"rad(G) + 1 \\\\le \\\\gamma_R\\\" OR \\\"radius(G) + 1 \\\\le \\\\gamma_R\\\" OR \\\"rad(G) + 1 <= \\\\gamma_R\\\"\"","toolAction":"\"Searching for exact formula in literature\"","toolSummary":"\"Search exact formula in literature\""}}]}
